     "content": "This book is a plain-English tour of the most complex object we know of, and it is sitting inside your skull right now. Over these lessons you will learn how the brain is built, how its cells talk, and how it powers everything you think, feel, and do. We start with the big picture. No medical background needed, and every new word gets explained.",
