      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"110\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\">How Heavy Is a Brain?</text><path d=\"M360 520 C330 400 470 330 600 370 C740 340 830 450 780 570 C830 650 730 750 600 730 C470 760 340 690 360 520 Z\" fill=\"#6366f1\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"570\" y=\"560\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"34\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1.4 kg</text><text x=\"570\" y=\"620\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\">about 3 lbs</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"880\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\">About 2 percent of body weight</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"960\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Roughly the weight of a small melon</text></svg>",
      "caption": "The brain is light in weight but heavy in importance."
