     "content": "Imagine you rush out the door without eating and try to focus on a hard task. Because the brain runs on a constant flow of blood sugar, low fuel makes concentration slippery and mood cranky. A balanced snack often clears the fog within minutes. Your thinking is only as steady as the energy feeding it.",
